--- The entry module of the analyses of KMGK (loaded after the model by models/<analysis>/main.maude).
load ../ra/hal
load ../ra/keystore
load ../scenarios/base
load ../scenarios/sessions
load ../scenarios/panic

--- The analysis model-checking is built with the invisible-transition reduction (model-checking.toml):
--- its modules turn the invisible rules into equations.
mod ANALYSIS-CMD is
  pr KMGK-PANIC .
  pr INVISIBLE-REDUCTION .
  pr C-INVISIBLE-REDUCTION .
  pr TEE-API-CALL-INVISIBLE-REDUCTION .
endm
